WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.124
Unit twenty-two. Eye Health!

2
00:00:04.077 --> 00:00:07.769
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:11.005
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.055 --> 00:00:14.603
Today we learn about Eye Health. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.108 --> 00:00:19.475
Eyes. Say it with me. Eyes!

6
00:00:22.973 --> 00:00:26.273
Vision. Say it with me. Vision!

7
00:00:29.775 --> 00:00:33.408
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

8
00:00:36.907 --> 00:00:40.507
Glasses. Say it with me. Glasses!

9
00:00:44.029 --> 00:00:47.595
Sunlight. Say it with me. Sunlight!

10
00:00:51.096 --> 00:00:54.530
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

11
00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:01.563
Check-up. Say it with me. Check-up!

12
00:01:05.058 --> 00:01:08.458
Protect. Say it with me. Protect!

13
00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:21.277
Good vision helps me learn. I rest my eyes from the screen and play in sunlight outdoors. If I have trouble seeing, a check-up may show I need glasses.

14
00:01:21.327 --> 00:01:22.581
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.892 --> 00:01:29.251
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.301 --> 00:01:30.451
Screen!

17
00:01:31.222 --> 00:01:36.339
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.389 --> 00:01:37.539
Check-up!

19
00:01:38.379 --> 00:01:45.088
Did you know? Squinting or sitting very close to the board can be signs that someone needs an eye check!

20
00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:47.097
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.876 --> 00:01:55.743
Think and answer. What signs might mean you need glasses?

22
00:01:55.793 --> 00:01:56.943
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.245 --> 00:02:02.853
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.903 --> 00:02:05.383
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

